## Model card

- **Name:** Muse Spark Open 816B A42B
- **Short description:** Meta Superintelligence Labs’ open-weight Mixture-of-Experts foundation model (816B total / ~42B active) for agentic coding, developer workflows, and long-horizon repository/document tasks.
- **Provider / access:** Open weights on Hugging Face (`meta-models/Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B`, Apache 2.0). Local metadata lists `opencode/muse-spark-open`; free open-weight self-hosting noted.
- **Release / knowledge:** Hugging Face model card reviewed 2026-11-10 (released Oct 2026 per local metadata/card context). Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed sources.
- **IDs:** `Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B`, `meta-models/Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens (1M) context; up to 131,072 max output (local metadata/HF card context).
- **Modalities:** Multimodal inputs described in local metadata/HF context (text/code/image/video/audio in; text/JSON out). Exact served modality support may vary by runtime; treated conservatively from reviewed card context.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Free open-weight checkpoint (Apache 2.0) for self-hosting; hosted serving costs depend on provider/compute (e.g. OpenCode Zen or self-hosted infrastructure).
- **Architecture:** Sparse Mixture-of-Experts, 816B total parameters / ~42B active parameters (HF card/metadata).

